{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d5abb14-c5b9-8209-8c27-0dad18acc377",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:46:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good morning, Denise. Manuel Souza here. So I just walked back from the corner store, and I'm wicked late getting started today, because I got beat at checkers by a six year old. Six! Down the hall from me, little girl. Kings all over the board."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it happens. What can I help you with, Mr. Souza?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. The streetlight. The one in front of my place is half dark, and it's not the bulb, I don't think. [line breaks up] branches have grown right across it. Covering the whole thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there. Branches over the light?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, branches. Over the light. A big limb, it hangs right down in front of it. Been like that since before the storm, and I've said it before to somebody, I think. Nothing came of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And just to be clear, did anything come down in the nor'easter, or is it just hanging there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing fell. Nothing's down. Last weekend's storm, Saturday into Sunday, it blew around plenty but the limb stayed up. It just sits there blocking the light. I want it trimmed back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "384 Chapel Street. Up on the Hill. The pole is right out front by my steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:45:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-four Chapel. Got it. I'll put in a request for the tree crew to look at trimming it away from the light. Do you want a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0191. [inaudible] you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got 401-555-0191. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Look, it's dark out there at five o'clock, and I'm not getting any younger on those steps. It's annoying, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I can't give you a day for the crew, but the request will be in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Mr. Souza."
    }
  ],
